puffin borrows one piece of art, and it is not covered by LICENSE.txt.

The Go gopher was designed by Renee French and is licensed under CC BY 4.0.

It appears on the splash screen, as one of the characters the corner
companion can be cycled to, and as the four files under

    cmd/puffin/art/gopher/

each of which carries the same line in its own header, so the attribution
travels with the art rather than only with the repository.

Everything else drawn here -- the puffin under cmd/puffin/art/auklet/, the
lamp under cmd/puffin/art/lamp/, and the splash -- was drawn for this and
is covered by LICENSE.txt.
